# The minisign public keys that may sign a release's SHA256SUMS.txt.minisig.
# A release build trusts these keys and no others, and nothing at run time
# can add one.
#
# To rotate: add the new key here and ship that release signed with the old
# key. Installs that update to it then trust both, so the release after can be
# signed with the new key. Remove the old key once it signs nothing.
untrusted comment: minisign public key 43EBB605B452BC13
RWQTvFK0BbbrQ5Fi5QICN6wkM5EsCGlfeLsTSiY9hTMdZpUjGaAg5t13
